38. Preparation for BGP
The purpose of establishing this routed IPsec connection was not limited to remote management.
The long-term objective was to establish dynamic routing between the virtual and physical networking environments.
BGP can establish a TCP session between the tunnel addresses.
The BGP session would operate inside the encrypted tunnel.
The public Internet addresses would remain responsible for transporting the outer IPsec packets, while BGP would use the logical overlay addresses.
